Zero point energy                ...      0.07481740 Eh      46.95 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00020370 Eh       0.13 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
